Id: ssh009w
Severity: WARN
Category: ssh
Check: check_ssh
Fix: Set MaxAuthTries 4.
References: sshd_config(5)
Controls: CIS 4.1, 5.4; NIST AC-17, IA-2; ISO 8.5, 8.20; CE Secure configuration, User access control

MaxAuthTries is above 4, which gives a password-guessing client more
attempts per connection before it is dropped. Set it to 4 or fewer.
